2 CONC le: Standard-Times &lt;br&gt;Newspaper Location: San Angelo, TX, US &lt;br&gt;Birth Date: abt 1917&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align="left"&gt;BRADY - Libbie H. Tally, 87, died Monday, Dec. 27, 2004, in San Angelo. Visitation will be from 7 p.m. to 8 p.m. Thurs
2 CONC day at Heritage Funeral Home. Service will be at 2 p.m. Friday at the funeral home. &lt;br&gt;Survivors include son, Jan Talley of Round Rock; daughters, Sandy Sawyer of Round Rock, Sharon Justice of Point Venture and Lisa Hall of Brady; and sister
2 CONC , Avis Ayers of Nash.&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
