2 TITL Hart Family Book
1 _OID 7569b0c9-96f4-4a09-8657-5912206b1859
1 _DSCR Birth:  1745
2 CONT Virginia, USA 
2 CONT Death:  1820
2 CONT Alleghany County
2 CONT North Carolina, USA 
2 CONT 
2 CONT "Descendants of Peter and Dority Hart 1740-1995 Virginia and North Carolina and Allied Families" by Ruth Gibbs Hart and Karen L. Cooper
2 CONT Dority "Dolly" Hart (maiden name unknown) was born ca 1745 and died between 1810-1820 in Prathers Creek, Ashe County, North Carolina (present day Alleghany County, North Carolina). 
2 CONT She married ca mid 1760's to Peter Hart Sr. (born ca 1740 and died between 1814-1820 Prathers Creek, Ashe County, North Carolina.) The name Dority is found on a property deed in Grayson County, Virginia where she and Peter sold land in 1806.
2 CONT Son John Hart's August 18, 1855 death record for Meadow Creek Whitley County Kentucky names his mother as "Dolly" or "Sally". Note; this name is very hard to read and can be either of these two names however, I make it out as "Dolly".
2 CONT 
2 CONT Dority and Peter were the parents of nine children.
2 CONT 1, James Hart born 1768
2 CONT 2, Mark Hart born Abt. 1770, married to Barbara Kirk on September 17, 1800 in Grayson County Virginia.
2 CONT 3, Margaret (Mahala) Hart born Bet. 1772 - 1774, NC, married Abt. 1796 to Stephen Floyd.
2 CONT 4, William Hart born Abt. 1775, Montgomery/Grayson CO., VA, married Abt. 1798, VA or NC to Mary Cadwell (Caldwell).
2 CONT 5, Peter Jr. Hart born 1780, NC, married Hannah Poe, May 18, 1801, Jefferson, Ashe CO., NC.
2 CONT 6, John Hart born February 20, 1780, Grayson CO., VA, first marriage to Permelia Morgan, Abt. 1800, Grayson.
2 CONT Second marriage, Lydia Rains, May 10, 1827, Whitley County Kentucky.
2 CONT 7, Nancy Hart born Abt. 1784, Grayson CO., VA, married to Andrew Hash, February 25, 1805, Grayson CO., VA.
2 CONT 8, Stephen Hart born 1785, Montgomery (now Grayson) CO., VA., married to Sarah Bradford, May 30, 1805, Grayson CO., VA.
2 CONT 9, Unknown Son born after 1785. 
2 CONT  
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Peter Hart (1740 - 1820)*
2 CONT  
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Margaret Hart Floyd (1773 - 1848)*
2 CONT   William Hart (1775 - 1840)*
2 CONT   John Hart (1780 - 1855)*
2 CONT   Peter Hart (1780 - 1842)*
2 CONT   Nancy Hart Hash (1784 - 1855)*
2 CONT   Stephen Hart (1785 - 1870)*
2 CONT  
2 CONT *Calculated relationship
2 CONT  
2 CONT   
2 CONT Burial:
2 CONT Peter Hart Family Cemetery 
2 CONT Alleghany County
2 CONT North Carolina, USA 
2 CONT  
2 CONT Created by: Wes Hart
2 CONT Record added: Oct 05, 2009 
2 CONT Find A Grave Memorial# 42739073 
2 CONT 
