1 _DSCR          Birth:  Oct. 14, 1814  North Carolina, USA   Death:  Mar. 20, 1865  Keokee  Lee County  Virginia, USA     Richard "Dick" Morris was married to Lydia Witt 7 Aug 1833 in Harlan Co., Kentucky. Second, he married Jane Garrison, daughter of Joh
2 CONC n G. Garrison and Elizabeth Rogers. Jane died in childbirth in 1854. A newspaper article from The Big Stone Gap Post, dated 1902, states that Richard Morris killed John Garrison, in 1863. I believe this was his former brother-in-law, Jane Garrison'
2 CONC s brother. Third, Richard Morris married Elender "Nellie" Clarkston, daughter of John Clarkston and Sarah McKinney, in 1856.    Richard "Dick" Pearl Morris was bushwacked at the end of the Civil War.        Family links:    Spouses:    Lydia Witt M
2 CONC orris (1810 - 1835)*    Elender Clarkston Morris Alcorn (1825 - 1912)*      Children:    Elizabeth Morris Barker (1835 - 1919)*    Richard Pearl Morris (1862 - 1940)*     *Calculated relationship         Burial:  Huff
